'''Shawn Michael Lynch''' (born July 25, 1979) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[Center (gridiron football)|center]] for the [[Arizona Cardinals]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL), as well as the [[Barcelona Dragons (NFL Europe)|FC Barcelona Dragons]] and [[Hamburg Sea Devils (NFL Europe)|Hamburg Sea Devils]] of [[NFL Europe]]. He played [[college football]] for the [[Duke Blue Devils football|Duke Blue Devils]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Shawn Lynch Stats |url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/L/LyncSh20.htm |access-date=2022-03-13 |website=Pro-Football-Reference.com |language=en}}</ref><ref name=":0">{{Cite web |title=Shawn Lynch NFL Stats - Pro Football Archives |url=https://www.profootballarchives.com/playerl/lync01950.html |access-date=2022-03-13 |website=www.profootballarchives.com }}{{Dead link|date=March 2026 |bot=InternetArchiveBot }}</ref>
